CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'f->type == V4L2_BUF_TYPE_VIDEO_OUTPUT_MPLANE'
#145: FILE: drivers/media/platform/mtk-vcodec/mtk_vcodec_dec.c:434:
+	if (!dec_pdata->uses_stateless_api &&
